<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia tightens rules for accounting statements.</title>
<headline>Tunisia tightens rules for accounting statements.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia has issued rules for a new accounting system in an attempt to make company accounts more transparent for investors and in line with international standards.</p>
<p>The new rules, published in the last issue of the Official gazetta received on Monday, makes a cash flow statement and explanation notes mandatory.</p>
<p>The new rules apply from the 1997 exercise.</p>
</text>
